les to improve your negotiating position. Remember: a brand new atomic weapon is always a good reason to have an interesting chat with your enemies. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/1de1d8bd50b2d816583fba06e3dc82ce.poster.avif?t=1725034519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/1de1d8bd50b2d816583fba06e3dc82ce.webm?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/1de1d8bd50b2d816583fba06e3dc82ce.mp4?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Maintain specific relations with the leaders of other countries. Your trusted counsellor says you are a most skilled orator and the greatest ruler in the world \u2013 make the weak abide!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/0a9881d27539b33f78008907975cf237.poster.avif?t=1725034519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/0a9881d27539b33f78008907975cf237.webm?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/0a9881d27539b33f78008907975cf237.mp4?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You should not allow anyone to tell you and your people how to live! Care for the sovereignty of your empire, react to threats and attacks. You are not a schoolboy. You Are Dictator! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/a49227d6612180cd6047e4f9e6f82cb3.poster.avif?t=1725034519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/a49227d6612180cd6047e4f9e6f82cb3.webm?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553130/extras/a49227d6612180cd6047e4f9e6f82cb3.mp4?t=1725034519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
